  <Copyright Notice="© Avolites Ltd. 2017" />
  <History Date="01-12-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="05-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added channel counts to mode names." />
  <History Date="05-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added discreet colour, shutter, pattern and control functions.  Added macros." />
  <History Date="05-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Shortened attribute names to comply with 14char limit." />
  <History Date="05-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed Advanced mode channel mapping." />
  <History Date="07-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Swapped medium blue and double ct blue colours." />
  <History Date="07-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing random strobe range." />
  <History Date="07-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed ring cells to use standard dimmer and colour mix controls for compatibility." />
  <History Date="07-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Moved ring controls into cells in Compressed, Standard, Advanced and Pixel Mapping modes for compatibility." />
  <History Date="10-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed Pattern Control mapping." />
  <History Date="04-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed ring RGB to locate and power on at full.  Removed master colour mix controls from palettes." />
